pi-office
=========

This directory is a trimmed fork of the docs editor from AIOffice
(https://github.com/AIOffice, reference checkout at /Users/admin/git/AIOffice),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream modules reused:
- frontend/apps/docs/src/renderer
- frontend/apps/slides/src/renderer
- frontend/apps/sheets/src/renderer
- frontend/apps/*/src/shared
- backend/xlsx-engine
- frontend/packages/docx-engine
- frontend/packages/pptx-engine
- frontend/packages/pptx-render
- frontend/packages/agent-core
- frontend/packages/project-store
- frontend/packages/ui
- frontend/packages/i18n

Modifications for python-pi:
- added embed entry (query: embed=1&doc=<opaque-id>)
- replaced document/auth adapter with /api/office
- disabled the AI panel in embed mode
- flattened the workspace build (Vite aliases to vendored packages)

The original copyright notices remain in the source files.
